{"seq":2,"slug":"graphql-grpc-contracts","title":"GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/graphql-grpc-contracts","wordCount":1124,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"graphql-与-grpc-契约测试\">GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约测试</h1><h2 id=\"非-rest-协议的契约测试需求\">非 REST 协议的契约测试需求</h2><p>REST/HTTP 是契约测试支持最成熟的协议，但现代架构中 GraphQL 和 gRPC 的使用率持续增长。这两种协议各自带有内置的类型系统（GraphQL Schema / Protobuf IDL），这既是优势（天然的结构约束）也是挑战（传统的 Pact HTTP 交互模型不直接适用）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>内置 Schema</th>\n<th>契约测试核心需求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REST</td>\n<td>无（OpenAPI 可选）</td>\n<td>验证请求/响应结构匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GraphQL</td>\n<td>GraphQL SDL（强制）</td>\n<td>验证查询字段可用 + 响应结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>gRPC</td>\n<td>Protobuf IDL（强制）</td>\n<td>验证 Schema 兼容 + 运行时行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph REST&#10;        R_C[消费者期望] --&gt; R_P[提供者响应]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph GraphQL&#10;        G_Q[客户端查询] --&gt; G_S[Schema 解析]&#10;        G_S --&gt; G_R[Resolver 响应]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph gRPC&#10;        P_D[Proto 定义] --&gt; P_C[编译时检查]&#10;        P_D --&gt; P_R[运行时验证]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph REST\n        R_C[消费者期望] --&gt; R_P[提供者响应]\n    end\n    subgraph GraphQL\n        G_Q[客户端查询] --&gt; G_S[Schema 解析]\n        G_S --&gt; G_R[Resolver 响应]\n    end\n    subgraph gRPC\n        P_D[Proto 定义] --&gt; P_C[编译时检查]\n        P_D --&gt; P_R[运行时验证]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>非 REST 协议的契约测试围绕以下核心概念：<strong>GraphQL SDL</strong>——GraphQL 的强类型 Schema 定义语言，天然提供结构约束；<strong>Protobuf IDL</strong>——gRPC 的接口定义语言，编译时即可检查兼容性；<strong>Pact Plugin Framework</strong>——允许自定义协议扩展 Pact 的验证能力；<strong>Schema Check</strong>——在 Schema 变更时验证不破坏已有消费者的机制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"graphql-契约测试\">GraphQL 契约测试</h2><h3 id=\"graphql-的独特契约挑战\">GraphQL 的独特契约挑战</h3><p>GraphQL 的&quot;按需查询&quot;模型意味着每个客户端可能查询 Schema 的不同子集。传统的 REST 契约（验证固定端点的完整响应）不适用于 GraphQL，因为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一个 endpoint（<code>/graphql</code>）处理所有请求</li>\n<li>响应结构完全由客户端的 Query 决定</li>\n<li>Schema 的向后兼容性规则与 REST 不同（添加字段安全，移除字段破坏）</li>\n<li>Fragment、变量、指令增加了查询的复杂度</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"pact-的-graphql-支持\">Pact 的 GraphQL 支持</h3><p>Pact 支持 GraphQL 交互，将 Query/Mutation 作为 HTTP POST 请求体的一部分：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { PactV4, GraphQLInteraction, MatchersV3 } from &#39;@pact-foundation/pact&#39;;&#10;const { like, string, eachLike } = MatchersV3;&#10;&#10;const provider = new PactV4({&#10;  consumer: &#39;WebApp&#39;,&#10;  provider: &#39;ProductGraphQL&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;Product GraphQL contract&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  it(&#39;fetches product details&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const graphqlInteraction = new GraphQLInteraction()&#10;      .given(&#39;product P-001 exists&#39;)&#10;      .uponReceiving(&#39;a query for product details&#39;)&#10;      .withQuery(&#10;        `&#10;        query GetProduct($id: ID!) {&#10;          product(id: $id) {&#10;            id&#10;            name&#10;            price&#10;            category {&#10;              id&#10;              name&#10;            }&#10;            reviews {&#10;              rating&#10;              comment&#10;            }&#10;          }&#10;        }&#10;      `,&#10;      )&#10;      .withVariables({ id: &#39;P-001&#39; })&#10;      .willRespondWith(200, {&#10;        data: {&#10;          product: {&#10;            id: string(&#39;P-001&#39;),&#10;            name: string(&#39;Widget Pro&#39;),&#10;            price: like(29.99),&#10;            category: {&#10;              id: string(&#39;cat-electronics&#39;),&#10;              name: string(&#39;Electronics&#39;),&#10;            },&#10;            reviews: eachLike({&#10;              rating: like(4),&#10;              comment: string(&#39;Great product&#39;),&#10;            }),&#10;          },&#10;        },&#10;      });&#10;&#10;    await provider.addInteraction(graphqlInteraction).executeTest(async (mockServer) =&gt; {&#10;      const client = new ProductClient(mockServer.url);&#10;      const product = await client.getProduct(&#39;P-001&#39;);&#10;      expect(product.name).toBeDefined();&#10;      expect(product.category.name).toBeDefined();&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { PactV4, GraphQLInteraction, MatchersV3 } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@pact-foundation/pact'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">eachLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MatchersV3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> provider</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> PactV4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  consumer: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'WebApp'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  provider: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ProductGraphQL'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Product GraphQL contract'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fetches product details'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> graphqlInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> GraphQLInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;-