2;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'P-001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            name: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Widget Pro'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            price: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">29.99</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            category: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              id: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cat-electronics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              name: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Electronics'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            reviews: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">eachLike</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              rating: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">like</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">              comment: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Great product'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> provider.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(graphqlInteraction).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">executeTest</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mockServer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> client</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProductClient</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(mockServer.url);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> product</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getProduct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'P-001'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product.name).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeDefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">      expect</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(product.category.name).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBeDefined</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"apollo-federation-的契约治理\">Apollo Federation 的契约治理</h3><p>在 Apollo Federation 架构中，多个 Subgraph 组合为统一的 Supergraph。契约治理发生在两个层面：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Subgraph 层&#10;        SG1[Users Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE[Schema 合成]&#10;        SG2[Products Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE&#10;        SG3[Orders Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    COMPOSE --&gt; SUPER[Supergraph Schema]&#10;&#10;    subgraph 客户端层&#10;        SUPER --&gt; CLIENT[客户端查询]&#10;        CLIENT --&gt; OPS_CHECK[Operation Check&lt;br/&gt;验证查询兼容]&#10;    end&#10;&#10;    subgraph 验证&#10;        SG1 --&gt;|Schema Check| ROVER[Apollo Rover]&#10;        ROVER --&gt;|兼容性报告| CI[CI 门禁]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Subgraph 层\n        SG1[Users Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE[Schema 合成]\n        SG2[Products Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE\n        SG3[Orders Subgraph] --&gt; COMPOSE\n    end\n\n    COMPOSE --&gt; SUPER[Supergraph Schema]\n\n    subgraph 客户端层\n        SUPER --&gt; CLIENT[客户端查询]\n        CLIENT --&gt; OPS_CHECK[Operation Check&lt;br/&gt;验证查询兼容]\n    end\n\n    subgraph 验证\n        SG1 --&gt;|Schema Check| ROVER[Apollo Rover]\n        ROVER --&gt;|兼容性报告| CI[CI 门禁]\n    end</pre><p><strong>Schema Check</strong>（Subgraph 变更时）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>验证变更后的 Subgraph Schema 能否与其他 Subgraph 正确合成</li>\n<li>检测移除的字段是否有客户端正在使用</li>\n<li>基于生产流量数据判断变更的实际影响面</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Operation Check</strong>（客户端变更时）：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>验证新的 Query/Mutation 在当前 Schema 下是否合法</li>\n<li>检测已废弃字段的使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"graphql-schema-向后兼容规则\">GraphQL Schema 向后兼容规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>兼容性</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加可选字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>新增 <code>product.discount</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加必选输入参数</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n<td><code>mutation createOrder(discount: Float!)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移除字段</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n<td>删除 <code>product.oldPrice</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更改字段类型</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n<td><code>price: Float</code> → <code>price: String</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>废弃字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td><code>@deprecated(reason: &quot;use newField&quot;)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>添加枚举值</td>\n<td>安全（查询返回）/ 可能破坏（输入）</td>\n<td>新增 <code>Status.ARCHIVED</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"grpc-契约测试\">gRPC 契约测试</h2><h3 id=\"protobuf-的天然契约优势\">Protobuf 的天然契约优势</h3><p>gRPC 基于 Protocol Buffers，<code>.proto</code> 文件本身就是强类型的接口定义。Protobuf 的编译时检查提供了第一层契约保护：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"protobuf\" data-code=\"// user_service.proto&#10;syntax = &quot;proto3&quot;;&#10;&#10;service UserService {&#10;  rpc GetUser (GetUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);&#10;  rpc ListUsers (ListUsersRequest) returns (stream UserResponse);&#10;}&#10;&#10;message GetUserRequest {&#10;  string user_id = 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;message UserResponse {&#10;  string id = 1;&#10;  string name = 2;&#10;  string email = 3;&#10;  UserRole role = 4;&#10;  google.protobuf.Timestamp created_at = 5;&#10;}&#10;&#10;enum UserRole {&#10;  USER_ROLE_UNSPECIFIED = 0;&#10;  USER_ROLE_ADMIN = 1;&#10;  USER_ROLE_MEMBER = 2;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// user_service.proto</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>syntax = \"proto3\";</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>service UserService {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc GetUser (GetUserRequest) returns (UserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rpc ListUsers (ListUsersRequest) returns (stream UserResponse);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message GetUserRequest {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string user_id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>message UserResponse {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string id = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string name = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  string email = 3;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  UserRole role = 4;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  google.protobuf.Timestamp created_at = 5;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>enum UserRole {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_UNSPECIFIED = 0;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_ADMIN = 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  USER_ROLE_MEMBER = 2;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"编译时-vs-运行时验证\">编译时 vs 运行时验证</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>验证层</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>检测内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>编译时兼容性</td>\n<td>Buf</td>\n<td>字段移除、类型变更、编号冲突</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Schema 注册</td>\n<td>Buf Schema Registry</td>\n<td>版本管理、跨团队共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行时行为</td>\n<td>Pact gRPC Plugin</td>\n<td>实际响应值的匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成行为</td>\n<td>自定义 gRPC 测试</td>\n<td>流式传输、错误处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"pact-grpc-plugin\">Pact gRPC Plugin</h3><p>Pact Plugin Framework 为 gRPC 提供了运行时契约验证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const grpcInteraction = {&#10;  type: &#39;Synchronous/Messages&#39;,&#10;  description: &#39;get user by id&#39;,&#10;  providerStates: [{ name: &#39;user 123 exists&#39; }],&#10;  request: {&#10;    &#39;pact:proto&#39;: &#39;./proto/user_service.proto&#39;,&#10;    &#39;pact:proto-service&#39;: &#39;UserService/GetUser&#39;,&#10;    &#39;pact:content-type&#39;: &#39;application/grpc&#39;,&#10;    user_id: &#39;matching(type, &quot;123&quot;)&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;  response: {&#10;    id: &#39;matching(type, &quot;123&quot;)&#39;,&#10;    name: &#39;matching(type, &quot;Alice&quot;)&#39;,&#10;    email: &#39;matching(regex, &quot;^.+@.+$&quot;, &quot;alice@example.com&quot;)&#39;,&#10;    role: &#39;matching(equalTo, &quot;USER_ROLE_MEMBER&quot;)&#39;,&#10;  },&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> grpcInteraction</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  type: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Synchronous/Messages'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  description: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'get user by id'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  providerStates: [{ name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user 123 exists'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  request: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'pact:proto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'./proto/user_service.proto'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'pact:proto-service'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UserService/GetUser'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    'pact:content-type'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'application/grpc'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'matching(type, \"123\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  response: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    id: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'matching(type, \"123\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'matching(type, \"Alice\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'matching(regex, \"^.+@.+$\", \"alice@example.com\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'matching(equalTo, \"USER_ROLE_MEMBER\")'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"protobuf-向后兼容规则\">Protobuf 向后兼容规则</h3><p>Protobuf 的向后兼容性由字段编号（Field Number）和 wire type 决定：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变更类型</th>\n<th>兼容性</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>添加新的 optional 字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>旧代码忽略未知字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>移除字段（保留编号）</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>旧代码忽略缺失字段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重命名字段</td>\n<td>安全</td>\n<td>wire 格式只用编号不用名字</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>更改字段类型</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n<td>wire type 不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用已删除的字段编号</td>\n<td>破坏</td>\n<td>新旧数据混淆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>required</code> → <code>optional</code></td>\n<td>安全（proto3 无 required）</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"跨协议的统一契约策略\">跨协议的统一契约策略</h2><p>在同一系统中混合使用 REST、GraphQL 和 gRPC 时，需要统一的契约治理视图：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 外部 API 层&#10;        GQL[GraphQL Gateway] --&gt; APOLLO[Apollo Schema Check]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 内部服务层&#10;        REST_S[REST 服务] --&gt; PACT_HTTP[Pact HTTP 契约]&#10;        GRPC_S[gRPC 服务] --&gt; PACT_GRPC[Pact gRPC Plugin]&#10;        MSG_S[消息服务] --&gt; PACT_MSG[Pact Message 契约]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 统一治理&#10;        APOLLO --&gt; BROKER[Pact Broker]&#10;        PACT_HTTP --&gt; BROKER&#10;        PACT_GRPC --&gt; BROKER&#10;        PACT_MSG --&gt; BROKER&#10;        BROKER --&gt; CID[can-i-deploy 统一门禁]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 外部 API 层\n        GQL[GraphQL Gateway] --&gt; APOLLO[Apollo Schema Check]\n    end\n    subgraph 内部服务层\n        REST_S[REST 服务] --&gt; PACT_HTTP[Pact HTTP 契约]\n        GRPC_S[gRPC 服务] --&gt; PACT_GRPC[Pact gRPC Plugin]\n        MSG_S[消息服务] --&gt; PACT_MSG[Pact Message 契约]\n    end\n    subgraph 统一治理\n        APOLLO --&gt; BROKER[Pact Broker]\n        PACT_HTTP --&gt; BROKER\n        PACT_GRPC --&gt; BROKER\n        PACT_MSG --&gt; BROKER\n        BROKER --&gt; CID[can-i-deploy 统一门禁]\n    end</pre><p>关键原则：<strong>无论底层协议是什么，契约测试的核心目标不变——在部署前发现服务间的不兼容变更</strong>。工具和配置可以不同，但门禁和工作流应统一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>GraphQL 和 gRPC 虽然自带类型系统，但编译时检查不能替代运行时契约验证。GraphQL 的按需查询模型需要通过 Pact GraphQL Interaction 或 Apollo Schema Check 保护客户端实际使用的字段子集；gRPC 需要 Buf 的 Schema 兼容性检查结合 Pact Plugin 的运行时验证。在混合协议架构中，统一的 Broker 和 can-i-deploy 门禁是实现跨协议治理的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>延伸阅读</strong>：下一篇 <a href=\"contract-versioning\">契约版本管理</a> 将讲解契约在多版本并行发布中的治理策略。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GraphQL 与 gRPC 契约测试","id":"graphql-与-grpc-契约测试"},{"level":2,"text":"非 REST 协议的契约测试需求","id":"非-rest-协议的契约测试需求"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GraphQL 契约测试","id":"graphql-契约测试"},{"level":3,"text":"GraphQL 的独特契约挑战","id":"graphql-的独特契约挑战"},{"level":3,"text":"Pact 的 GraphQL 支持","id":"pact-的-graphql-支持"},{"level":3,"text":"Apollo Federation 的契约治理","id":"apollo-federation-的契约治理"},{"level":3,"text":"GraphQL Schema 向后兼容规则","id":"graphql-schema-向后兼容规则"},{"level":2,"text":"gRPC 契约测试","id":"grpc-契约测试"},{"level":3,"text":"Protobuf 的天然契约优势","id":"protobuf-的天然契约优势"},{"level":3,"text":"编译时 vs 运行时验证","id":"编译时-vs-运行时验证"},{"level":3,"text":"Pact gRPC Plugin","id":"pact-grpc-plugin"},{"level":3,"text":"Protobuf 向后兼容规则","id":"protobuf-向后兼容规则"},{"level":2,"text":"跨协议的统一契约策略","id":"跨协议的统一契约策略"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"异步消息契约测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/async-contract-testing"},"next":{"title":"契约版本管理与兼容性策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/contract-testing-cdc/patterns/contract-versioning"}}